<http://example.org/sen0401/ch12/diagrams> a owl:Ontology ; rdfs:label "SEN0401 ch12 narrative diagrams - ABox"@en ; owl:versionInfo "1.0.0" ; dcterms:identifier "sen0401_ch12_diagrams_abox_v1_0_0" ;
    rdfs:comment "The chapter's authored diagrams as cme:NarrativeDiagram individuals: generated by sen0401_page_data_v2_11_0.py from sen0401_ch12_diagrams_v1_0_0.py, typed by the CME narrative-to-diagram mapping (a module of cme_standards_adoption_v1_3_0.ttl, CME 0.16.0)."@en ; owl:imports <http://example.org/cme/narrative-diagram> .

chx:Diagram_CheckGreedyCoinbase a cme:NarrativeDiagram ; rdfs:label "How a node treats a block whose coinbase claims too much"@en ; cme:hasPattern cme:Workflow ; cme:hasDiagramType cme:ActivityDiagram ; cme:readFrom "chapter 12, Greedy coinbase rejected: a coinbase that claims one satoshi more than subsidy plus fees makes the block invalid and the node answers bad-cb-amount; one that claims less is accepted" ; cme:elementCount 6 ;
    cme:accompanies "GreedyCoinbaseRejected" ; cme:accompanies "MinerMayClaimLess" ; cme:accompanies "RewardIsSubsidyPlusFees" ; rdfs:comment "the passage is a procedure with a decision - does the coinbase claim more than the reward allows - and a different outcome on each branch: a workflow"@en .
chx:Diagram_MiningInSixBranches a cme:NarrativeDiagram ; rdfs:label "Mining and consensus in six branches"@en ; cme:hasPattern cme:TopicAndParts ; cme:hasDiagramType cme:MindMap ; cme:readFrom "chapter 12, the whole chapter: money creation, decentralized consensus, building the candidate block, proof of work, mining competition and changing consensus rules" ; cme:elementCount 22 ;
    cme:accompanies "MoneyCreation" ; cme:accompanies "DecentralizedConsensus" ; cme:accompanies "BuildingTheCandidateBlock" ; cme:accompanies "ProofOfWork" ; cme:accompanies "MiningCompetition" ; cme:accompanies "ChangingConsensusRules" ; rdfs:comment "the chapter lays out one subject, mining and consensus, by its parts: a topic and its parts"@en .
chx:Diagram_PoolSharesExchange a cme:NarrativeDiagram ; rdfs:label "A pool member proves work to the pool with shares"@en ; cme:hasPattern cme:Interaction ; cme:hasDiagramType cme:SequenceDiagram ; cme:readFrom "chapter 12, Pool shares and fees: a pool sets an easier target so that members prove their work with shares; the pool pays by the share and takes a fee" ; cme:elementCount 5 ;
    cme:accompanies "PoolSharesAndFees" ; cme:accompanies "BlockWithholding" ; rdfs:comment "the passage is an exchange between a member and a pool in an order that matters - the shares, then the payment: an interaction"@en .
chx:Diagram_Bip9Deployment a cme:NarrativeDiagram ; rdfs:label "A deployment under BIP 9 on regtest, from defined to active"@en ; cme:hasPattern cme:LifeCycle ; cme:hasDiagramType cme:StateDiagram ; cme:readFrom "chapter 12, The BIP 9 state machine: on regtest, periods of 144 and a threshold of 108 gave defined at 143, started at 144, locked_in at 288 and active at 432" ; cme:elementCount 7 ;
    cme:accompanies "Bip9StateMachine" ; rdfs:comment "the passage describes the states a deployment is in and the events that move it - defined, started, locked_in, active: a life cycle"@en .
chx:Diagram_MinerKinds a cme:NarrativeDiagram ; rdfs:label "What a solo miner and a pool member each get from mining"@en ; cme:hasPattern cme:SetOfUses ; cme:hasDiagramType cme:UseCaseDiagram ; cme:readFrom "chapter 12, Solo miner variance and Pool shares and fees: a miner with 0.01% waits 69 days on average for a block, which is why small miners join pools, where one expects a thousand shares for each block" ; cme:elementCount 6 ;
    cme:accompanies "SoloMinerVariance" ; cme:accompanies "PoolSharesAndFees" ; rdfs:comment "the passage lists what two kinds of miner experience, under different conditions: a set of uses by actors"@en .
